# Drop GFPGAN .pth weights here.
#
# Recommended: GFPGANv1.4.pth (~330 MB)
# Source: github.com/TencentARC/GFPGAN/releases/download/v1.3.0/GFPGANv1.4.pth
# License: Apache-2.0
#
# Models are intentionally NOT vendored. The sidecar walks:
#   1. --model <path>             explicit override
#   2. UCX_MODEL_DIR/gfpgan/      shared cache
#   3. tools/gfpgan/models/       this directory
